Early versions of 3.0 had a bug which caused pets to go up in levels forever.  
It is fixed by now.  The section of code which checks to see what monsters
your pet will attack is below, from dogmove.c:

			    if(mtmp2->m_lev >= mtmp->m_lev+2 ||
